  "interpretation": "A trained (not heuristic) text-only classifier reaching well above-chance accuracy/AUROC confirms lexical leakage in the SWAP_MAP-based perturbation strategy. If accuracy collapses sharply after removing the exact injected/original span tokens (drop_from_span_ablation large), the leakage is concentrated in the fixed antonym vocabulary itself and is fixable via paraphrase-preserving perturbation generation. If the drop is small, the classifier is exploiting broader linguistic cues beyond the swap vocabulary, which is a harder problem to fix and should be reported as a more fundamental benchmark limitation."
